{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-0e841a093f7a21f1c2b3513f27ca07df493bdb37129de346","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"3e5701c932f1cb6e2230e81f680479def90cd3d45c2edacf976e297cb233a1d7","article_count":0,"full_text":"■ Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act [Attached Form No. 1] <Amended on March 6, 2015>\nApplications may also be filed through Hometax (www.hometax.go.kr).\n\nApplication for Approval to Defer the Application of Deemed Release / Approval\n\n(Front)\n\n| Receipt number | Date received | Date issued | Processing period |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| | | | 5 days |\n\nApplicant\n\n| Name (representative) | Business registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| Business name (corporate name) | Telephone number |\n| | |\n| Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n| Location of manufacturing place | |\n| | |\n\nApplication Details\n\n| Date of cessation | |\n|---|---|\n| Planned date of release | |\n| Reasons for application | |\n\nDetails of Articles\n\n| Name of article | Quantity | Specifications | Unit price | Price | Tax amount | Remarks |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| | | | | | | |\n\nI apply for approval to defer the application of deemed release pursuant to the proviso to Article 5 (2) 3 of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nApplicant: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Head of the Tax Office\n\nNo. ______\n\nDeferral of the application of deemed release is approved as set out above until Year ____ Month ____ Day ____.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nHead of the Tax Office: ____________________ [Seal]\n\nTo: ____________________\n\n210 mm × 297 mm [White paper, 80 g/m² (recycled)]\n\n(Reverse)\n\nProcessing Procedure\n\nThis application is processed as follows.\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Applicant</th><th>Processing authority: Head of the tax office having jurisdiction over the place of business</th></tr>\n<tr><td>1. Prepare application</td><td>2. Receive application (Civil Service Office)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>3. Investigate and verify</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>4. Approve (Head of the tax office)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>6. Receive the approval certificate</td><td>5. Prepare approval certificate (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nFlow of processing: the applicant submits the completed application to the Civil Service Office on the right; the authority proceeds downward through investigation and verification, approval by the head of the tax office, and preparation of the approval certificate. The final arrow, labelled “Issue approval certificate,” returns to the applicant on the left.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\1d8345138ab245c61af5e5f49482ed9aea2143cdc489684573f5a4827ece2fc6.ascii.json","sha256":"1d8345138ab245c61af5e5f49482ed9aea2143cdc489684573f5a4827ece2fc6"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"dc593594d45e1514e74fe74ad285c49974f92dab3d47973dfe010365dba44c9c","unit_key":"form-000100F"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"38f226d16be943cbc6e3daad51e75ee2c0283de1942d8753f